  "question": {
    "text": "If a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, is the solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>This is a linear&nbsp;differential equation,</p><p>with&nbsp;Integrating Factor :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>So, solution of the linear differential equation is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;The curve passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Hence, the particular solution to the differential equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}